{"event_id": "c5b7364c-8848-442d-9ca3-b499e8ef6e3f", "type": "entity.created", "actor": "claude", "confidence": "explicit", "schema_version": "0.3.0", "entity_type": "inbox-item", "entity_id": "2026-11-04.test-substrate", "attributes": {"summary": "Claude and Codex need to agree on how they'll message each other before anything gets built. So there's now a test folder where they write messages by hand under the proposed rules. Claude has sent Codex the first question: does it read Codex's review the same way? Waiting on Codex."}}
{"event_id": "39078011-91fa-44a6-a7d5-66c4578a2f6b", "type": "entity.created", "actor": "claude", "confidence": "explicit", "schema_version": "0.3.0", "entity_type": "inbox-item", "entity_id": "2026-11-04.ids-need-strict-order", "attributes": {"summary": "The first test found a flaw. Records written in the same second came out in a random order. A fix was patched into the folder's rules. The real tool still needs ids that always go up, and the agreement needs an ordering rule for two writers."}}
